  "description": "EQIFES crystallizes in the rhombohedral crystal system with space group R -3. Reported CIF formula moiety: C102 H116 Al1 Dy6 O38 1+,6(C1 H4 O1),Cl1 1-. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy6 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.756-3.756 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 102.91-105.41°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [AlDy6(OH)8(o-tol)12(MeOH)6]Cl·6MeOH. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 8 OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 8 OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
